; Octylsilanetriol, Si(OH)3-C8H17, with the force field of the alkylsilane monolayers on silica:
; CHARMM36 (GROMACS port of July 2022) for the alkyl chain and the OH groups on Si, and the
; Si-C parameters of apadana for the bond, angles and dihedrals at the Si-C bond. The charges
; are those of the monolayer models. With OH groups on all three oxygens, the molecule carries
; a net charge of +0.19 e.

